            "statement": "Transitive production includes profit, result, crop; intransitive resistance sense is formal.",
            "source_detail": "Publisher entry; paraphrased lexical evidence, not proof of every original example or numerical frequency."
          },
          {
            "id": "OX-YIELD-3",
            "statement": "Transitive surrender allows up and figurative secrets; physical intransitive includes movement, bending and breaking.",
